'''New Years Event''' (年始特別番組（プログラム）, ''Nenmatsu Tokubetsu Bangumi （Puroguramu） '', '''Year-End Special Show (Program)''') is an event that is held once the [[Year's End Event]] ends.

==Event Information==
HAPPY NEW YEAR {{CURRENTYEAR}}!<br>
Time to welcome in an exciting new year with The Battle Cats! Limited New Years' events galore!<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''On between January 1st (12:00am) and January 17th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Get event MORE Cat Food from the Li'l Cat Scratcher!'''}}<br>
Get one chance for a bonus prize of Cat Food at a special Cat Scratcher lottery event! Choose a circle and reveal your prize!

Visit the Cat Base menu and select the Li'l Cat Scratcher banner at the top of the menu when it appears during this event! Choose one of the three circles to reveal the amount of Cat Food you've won as your prize!<br>
See how much Cat Food you can get during this event!

【Available between】<br>
Chance #1: December 23rd (11:00am) through December 31st (11:59pm)<br>
Chance #2: January 1st (11:00am) through January 8th (11:59pm)<br>
Chance #3: January 9th (11:00am) through January 17th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・ Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
During {{Color|#FF0000|'''Friday, Saturday, and Sunday,'''}} {{Color|#0000FF|'''units can be levelled up for 1/2 of their normal cost!'''}}<br>
※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・A Helping Hand for Beginners: Progression Pack on sale!'''}}<br>
A new set of items picked especially for helping with progressing through more challenging stages, including Leadership, Cat Tickets, and other items for use in battle is now on sale!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Available from December 30th (11:00am) until January 17th, 2025 (10:59am)!'''}}

※ The Progression Pack can only be purchased once.<br>
※ If the Progression Pack is not appearing for sale, please update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Duel Stages now available!'''}}<br>
Put your honor on the line! Your strongest fighter versus one opponent in single combat!<br>
Are you ready for the Duel Stages?<br>
Visit the Special Stages section of the Legend Stages to challenge the Duel Stage.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between January 1st (12:00am) and January 10th (10:59am)!'''}}

In any duel stage, you will only be able to deploy one Cat at a time against the single powerful enemy who appears! Think carefully before you choose who'll defend the honor of your Cat Army!<br>
A new fight will appear each day, so keep an eye out for the next challenger!<br>
Steel your resolve and get ready to face down your opponent!

※ If Duel Stages do not appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Tag Arena Event!'''}}<br>
Seek out the summit of a massive challenge with your strongest partner in the Tag Arena.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between January 10th (12:00am) and January 17th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Visit Event Stages/Legend Stages from the title menu and look for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Tag Arena'''}} on the map list to challenge this limited-time event!<br>
Tag Arena stages are special stages that are challenged in a 2 vs. 2 format! Different tactics will be necessary to complete these stages!<br>
Duos with the best combination stand the best chance, so think carefully before sending them out into battle!

※If the event does not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#38761D|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00CCFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''1/1, 1/4, 1/7, 1/10, 1/13, 1/16!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between December 23rd (11:00am) and December 31st (11:59pm)!'''}}<br>
'''・Cats Eye Cave'''<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between January 1st (12:00am) and January 17th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login Stamp Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
If you missed out on the rewards last year, then now's your chance to grab them! Every day you visit the Cat Base you will be rewarded with awesome presents to power up your army during this limited event!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

※ You must update to the most recent version of Battle Cats to collect these rewards.

